WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.800
This is the new Velmora news centre.

2
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:13.600
Three newsrooms, one building, and not a single video router.

3
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:20.400
Every camera, every microphone, every screen is a stream on the network.

4
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:27.200
This rack keeps them all in time.

5
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:34.000
When a studio needs another gallery, the engineers reassign it in a few minutes, from software.
